{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-start|T13", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You park your taxi across from the stadium just a few meters from a two-story building.", "passage": "980-05-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Estacionas el taxi frente al estadio, a pocos metros de un edificio de dos pisos.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-start|T14", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It’s an odd brick place that clashes with the huge concrete behemoth that is Charlety stadium.", "passage": "980-05-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Es un lugar de ladrillo raro que contrasta con la enorme mole de concreto que es el estadio Charléty.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-start|T18", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You get out of the car and walk to the front door. You knock.", "passage": "980-05-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Sales del auto y caminas hacia la puerta principal. Golpeas.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-start|T19", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You wait a few minutes… lights come on… and the door finally opens.", "passage": "980-05-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Esperas unos minutos… se encienden luces… y finalmente la puerta se abre.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T24", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Marco appears.", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Aparece Marco.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T25", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Marco is a former taxi driver. A strange guy, a bit spacey and different. He’s been working at the stadium for a few years now.", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Marco es un excompañero taxista. Un tipo raro, un poco disperso y diferente. Lleva unos años trabajando en el estadio.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T27", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Well shit… You’re still alive? »", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Mierda… ¿Todavía estás vivo? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T29", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "That’s Marco. You like him.", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Así es Marco. Te cae bien.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T31", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I mean… Wow! So nice to see you! »", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« O sea… ¡Guau! ¡Qué bueno verte! »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T32", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Even though he stole your wife.", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Aunque te haya robado a tu esposa.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T33", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Come in… come in… You want something to drink? Oh right, you stopped drinking. Cup a’ coffee? »", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Entra… entra… ¿Quieres algo de tomar? Ah, cierto, dejaste de tomar. ¿Un cafecito? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T34", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Say nothing.)", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "emote": ":silence:", "link": "980-05-marco-intro-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "(No decir nada.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T35", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Yes, please. »", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "link": "980-05-marco-intro-coffee", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí, por favor. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-marco-intro|T36", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« No, thanks. »", "passage": "980-05-marco-intro", "link": "980-05-marco-intro-nocoffee", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No, gracias. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-entrance|T55", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You follow him into his caretaker’s home. It’s pretty nice despite the mess and filth.", "passage": "980-05-entrance", "source": "textasset", "es": "Lo sigues hasta su vivienda de cuidador. Está bastante bien a pesar del desorden y la suciedad.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-entrance-coffee1|T62", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He serves you a cup of coffee and sits down at the table. You follow suit.", "passage": "980-05-entrance-coffee1", "source": "textasset", "es": "Te sirve una taza de café y se sienta a la mesa. Tú haces lo mismo.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-entrance-coffee2|T67", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He serves you a cup anyway and sits at the table. You follow suit.", "passage": "980-05-entrance-coffee2", "source": "textasset", "es": "Te sirve una taza de todos modos y se sienta a la mesa. Tú haces lo mismo.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-entrance-coffee0|T72", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He sits at the table and points for you to sit down as well.", "passage": "980-05-entrance-coffee0", "source": "textasset", "es": "Se sienta a la mesa y te señala para que también te sientes.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-intro|T77", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The only noise in the room is the TV behind Marco. Before you came by, he was playing a soccer video game.", "passage": "980-05-questions-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "El único ruido en la habitación es el de la tele detrás de Marco. Antes de que llegaras, estaba jugando un videojuego de fútbol.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-intro|T78", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The fans are singing and clapping their hands.", "passage": "980-05-questions-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Los hinchas cantan y aplauden.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-intro|T79", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« So… what’ve you been up to? »", "passage": "980-05-questions-intro", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Y bueno… ¿qué has estado haciendo? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-intro|T80", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« I have some questions for you… »", "passage": "980-05-questions-intro", "link": "980-05-questions-direct", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Tengo algunas preguntas para ti… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-intro|T81", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« I’ve been ok… »", "passage": "980-05-questions-intro", "link": "980-05-questions-turn", "source": "textasset", "es": "« He estado bien… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-turn|T85", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You make small talk until he suddenly sits up.", "passage": "980-05-questions-turn", "source": "textasset", "es": "Charlan de cosas sin importancia hasta que de repente él se endereza.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-turn|T86", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Oh shit, I know why you’re here. You’ve got something to ask me. »", "passage": "980-05-questions-turn", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Ah, mierda, ya sé por qué viniste. Tienes algo para preguntarme. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-turn|T87", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You let him stew for a minute.", "passage": "980-05-questions-turn", "source": "textasset", "es": "Lo dejas que se retuerza un minuto.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-turn|T88", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« No! Shit! »", "passage": "980-05-questions-turn", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¡No! ¡Mierda! »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-direct|T93", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He shakes his head.", "passage": "980-05-questions-direct", "source": "textasset", "es": "Sacude la cabeza.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-direct|T94", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« No, no, not yet. Man, seriously, no… »", "passage": "980-05-questions-direct", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No, no, todavía no. Viejo, en serio, no… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T99", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« The last time I helped you out, I lost my job. So the answer is no! »", "passage": "980-05-questions", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« La última vez que te ayudé, perdí mi trabajo. ¡Así que la respuesta es no! »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T100", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« You have no choice and you know it. You owe me this much.»", "passage": "980-05-questions", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No tienes opción y lo sabes. Me debes al menos esto.»", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T101", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Marco drops his head between his shoulders. He starts to beg.", "passage": "980-05-questions", "source": "textasset", "es": "Marco hunde la cabeza entre los hombros. Empieza a suplicar.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T102", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’m tellin’ you, man. I love this job. It’s so easy. I get to take care of a stadium that’s empty 75% of time. »", "passage": "980-05-questions", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Te lo digo, viejo. Amo este trabajo. Es tan fácil. Me encargo de un estadio que está vacío el 75% del tiempo. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T103", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He sits up roughly in his chair. Behind him, on the screen, the stadium is going wild.", "passage": "980-05-questions", "source": "textasset", "es": "Se endereza bruscamente en la silla. Detrás de él, en la pantalla, el estadio enloquece.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T104", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« I need information on Ronan Besson. »", "passage": "980-05-questions", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Necesito información sobre Ronan Besson. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T105", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He straightens up.", "passage": "980-05-questions", "source": "textasset", "es": "Se pone derecho.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T106", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Ronan? The coach that got killed by the Judge? »", "passage": "980-05-questions", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Ronan? ¿El entrenador que mató el Juez? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T107", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« The very one. »", "passage": "980-05-questions", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Ese mismo. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions|T108", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« He was a great guy. Everyone’s torn up about it… »", "passage": "980-05-questions", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Era un tipazo. Todos están destrozados… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-nocoffee|T114", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« But? »", "passage": "980-05-questions-nocoffee", "link": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Pero? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-nocoffee|T115", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Spit it out. »", "passage": "980-05-questions-nocoffee", "emote": ":anger:", "link": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Suéltalo ya. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-nocoffee|T116", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Thanks… »", "passage": "980-05-questions-nocoffee", "link": "980-05-questions-thanks", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Gracias… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-coffee|T120", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« But? »", "passage": "980-05-questions-coffee", "link": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Pero? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-coffee|T121", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Spit it out. »", "passage": "980-05-questions-coffee", "emote": ":anger:", "link": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Suéltalo ya. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-coffee|T122", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Thanks… »", "passage": "980-05-questions-coffee", "link": "980-05-questions-thanks", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Gracias… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-coffee|T123", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Drink your coffee.)", "passage": "980-05-questions-coffee", "emote": ":irony:", "link": "980-05-questions-coffee-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "(Beber tu café.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-thanks|T127", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Is that… all? »", "passage": "980-05-questions-thanks", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Eso es… todo? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-thanks|T128", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« I just wanted to know what kind of guy he was… »", "passage": "980-05-questions-thanks", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Solo quería saber qué clase de tipo era… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-questions-coffee-silence|T133", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I hate it when you do that sort of thing. Seriously. It freaks me out… »", "passage": "980-05-questions-coffee-silence", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Odio cuando haces ese tipo de cosas. En serio. Me pone los pelos de punta… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but-intro|T138", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He pops a sigh.", "passage": "980-05-but-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Suelta un suspiro.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but-intro|T139", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« This is going to get back to me somehow… »", "passage": "980-05-but-intro", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Esto de alguna forma me va a volver en contra… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T144", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« There were rumors… »", "passage": "980-05-but", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Había rumores… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T147", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Some parents heard he was a little too hands-on with the kids a while back, if you get my drift. But no one ever looked into it. »", "passage": "980-05-but", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Algunos padres oyeron que hace un tiempo era demasiado cariñoso con los chicos, si entiendes lo que digo. Pero nadie lo investigó nunca. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T148", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Was it true? »", "passage": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Era verdad? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T149", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I don’t know nothin’… »", "passage": "980-05-but", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Yo no sé nada… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T150", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He sighs.", "passage": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "Suspira.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T152", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« A few months ago, Ronan cornered a kid. Like, by the showers? You know what I mean? »", "passage": "980-05-but", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Hace unos meses, Ronan acorraló a un chico. Tipo, cerca de las duchas, ¿entiendes? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T153", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« The kid stabbed him in the thigh with a pair of scissors and ran away. »", "passage": "980-05-but", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« El chico le clavó unas tijeras en el muslo y salió corriendo. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T154", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« The kid’s parents weren’t sure whether they’d file a complaint, the club director brought Ronan in and bam, two days later, he was murdered.»", "passage": "980-05-but", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Los padres del chico no sabían si iban a denunciarlo, el director del club llamó a Ronan y, zas, dos días después, lo asesinaron.»", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T156", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Who else knows this? »", "passage": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Quién más sabe esto? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T157", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« About the kid? No one, I think… Well, maybe some other parents? Dunno. »", "passage": "980-05-but", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Sobre el chico? Nadie, creo… Bueno, tal vez algunos otros padres. No sé. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T158", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You get up.", "passage": "980-05-but", "source": "textasset", "es": "Te levantas.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T159", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Thank you, Marco. »", "passage": "980-05-but", "link": "980-05-thanks", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Gracias, Marco. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-but|T160", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« One last thing… »", "passage": "980-05-but", "link": "980-05-lastthing", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Una última cosa… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing|T164", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Give him the names of your suspects.)", "passage": "980-05-lastthing", "link": "980-05-lastthing-suspects", "source": "textasset", "es": "(Darle los nombres de tus sospechosos.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing|T165", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Give him the name of the victims.)", "passage": "980-05-lastthing", "link": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "source": "textasset", "es": "(Darle el nombre de las víctimas.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-suspects|T169", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You go through the names of the suspects. No reaction.", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-suspects", "source": "textasset", "es": "Repasas los nombres de los sospechosos. Ninguna reacción.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-suspects|T170", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Until you mention Salim…", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-suspects", "source": "textasset", "es": "Hasta que mencionas a Salim…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T175", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You list the victims. He doesn’t react until you mention Charles Bougrain.", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "source": "textasset", "es": "Enumeras a las víctimas. No reacciona hasta que mencionas a Charles Bougrain.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T176", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Oh yeah. Him. I know him. I mean, everybody knows him. Right-wing extremist son of a bitch. »", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Ah sí. Ese. Lo conozco. Bueno, todo el mundo lo conoce. El hijo de puta de extrema derecha. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T177", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Hold on… What are you doing these days? »", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Espera… ¿Qué estás haciendo estos días? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T178", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« I can’t say. »", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No puedo decir. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T179", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Marco sits up.", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "source": "textasset", "es": "Marco se endereza.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T180", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Damnit. I’m going to get fired. »", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Maldición. Me van a echar. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T181", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Easy… »", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Tranquilo… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-lastthing-victims|T182", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "His voice speeds up.", "passage": "980-05-lastthing-victims", "source": "textasset", "es": "Su voz se acelera.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim|T187", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Wait… »", "passage": "980-05-salim", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Espera… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim|T188", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« The kid’s parents… they knew a lawyer. He came two days before Ronan was killed. »", "passage": "980-05-salim", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Los padres del chico… conocían a un abogado. Vino dos días antes de que mataran a Ronan. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim|T189", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« It was Salim Wadyan. The same guy who’s defending that terrorist. »", "passage": "980-05-salim", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Era Salim Wadyan. El mismo tipo que defiende a ese terrorista. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim|T190", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Did he meet Ronan? »", "passage": "980-05-salim", "link": "980-05-salim-ronan", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Se encontró con Ronan? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim|T191", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Did you meet him? »", "passage": "980-05-salim", "link": "980-05-salim-marco", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Tú te encontraste con él? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim-ronan|T197", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Yeah, he totally came… »", "passage": "980-05-salim-ronan", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí, vino, seguro… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim-ronan|T200", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« He knew Ronan. He was his coach… like 25 years ago. Small world. »", "passage": "980-05-salim-ronan", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Conocía a Ronan. Era su entrenador… hace como 25 años. Qué chico es el mundo. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim-marco|T207", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Yeah, I ran into him… »", "passage": "980-05-salim-marco", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí, me lo crucé… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim-marco|T208", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Didn’t say anything but he looked… like a crazy man. Like he’d just seen a ghost. »", "passage": "980-05-salim-marco", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No dijo nada, pero se veía… como loco. Como si hubiera visto un fantasma. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-salim-outro|T212", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "His voice suddenly sounds child-like.", "passage": "980-05-salim-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "De repente, su voz suena infantil.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-thanks|T217", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Don’t tell anyone where you got this information, ok? »", "passage": "980-05-thanks", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No le digas a nadie de dónde sacaste esta información, ¿sí? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-thanks-coffee|T222", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Time will tell. »", "passage": "980-05-thanks-coffee", "link": "980-05-thanks-outroB", "source": "textasset", "es": "« El tiempo dirá. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-thanks-coffee|T223", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Don’t worry. »", "passage": "980-05-thanks-coffee", "link": "980-05-thanks-outroA", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No te preocupes. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
