{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-thanks-coffee-outro|T229", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You can really be an ass sometimes… »", "passage": "980-05-thanks-coffee-outro", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« A veces sí que puedes ser un idiota… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
