{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-thanks-outroA|T239", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Yeah… I’ve heard that before… »", "passage": "980-05-thanks-outroA", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí… ya lo he oído antes… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "980_Judge_05_Location|980-05-thanks-outroB|T244", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Dude. Seriously. This is the perfect job. PERFECT. »", "passage": "980-05-thanks-outroB", "speaker": "MARCO", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Viejo. En serio. Este es el trabajo perfecto. PERFECTO. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
